            {
                "entry_id": "0e8c69b7-9d52-347c-870b-69120c809a42",
                "word": "empouvoirement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f9bd156a-5a0f-43db-97c7-7bd4d1f114e1",
                        "entry_id": "0e8c69b7-9d52-347c-870b-69120c809a42",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "empouvoirements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                        "entry_id": "0e8c69b7-9d52-347c-870b-69120c809a42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonyme d’empowerment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa0a5a38-3f02-4fb9-bdaa-1162a0f1a172",
                                "sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                                "text": "Encore un mot anglais, quasiment intraduisible en français : ont été suggérés autonomisation, mais aussi empouvoirement, capacitation, capabilisation, potentialisation, pouvoir-faire, habilitation, responsabilisation, capacité d’agir, pouvoir d’agir, agentivation… autant de mots que je trouve assez affreux. Alors, j’utilise le mot anglais."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e44edef-e33b-49a3-a136-9ec8b7084de0",
                                "sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                                "text": "L’empouvoirement, c’est quoi ? Une traduction française de l’empowerment, tout un concept mêlant acceptation de soi, confiance, estime, ambition et pouvoir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6522ad5-63dd-4752-b163-6416da6c53e9",
                                "sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                                "text": "C’est de l’empouvoirement, elle renverse les insultes qui la ciblent pour les revendiquer et les transformer en quelque chose de positif."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1f4d2d6-490c-4e36-8381-3bb1238730e5",
                                "sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                                "text": "Cet « empouvoirement » prétendument révolutionnaire, qui consiste à se comporter exactement comme les hommes le souhaitent sans même qu’ils aient à déployer la moindre contrainte physique directe, porte un nom connu depuis longtemps : intériorisation de l’oppression."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56481d83-a5da-4ed9-b7ac-2f2c388cb679",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e8c69b7-9d52-347c-870b-69120c809a42",
                        "source_sense_id": "d2c92b79-122d-3b1e-856b-8a9c072d1a8b",
                        "target_lang_word": "empowerment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "empowerment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b78844e-72c8-372f-b53c-10096bbc29be",
                                        "entry_id": "c4fe1c8e-5fee-3cde-9b72-667aa0d4f702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The achievement of political, social or economic power by an individual or group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3c6750d-2f0c-44d5-91e3-6d68b415ace5",
                                                "sense_id": "8b78844e-72c8-372f-b53c-10096bbc29be",
                                                "text": "Hence, the anonymity that digital technological tools can provide ultimately leads to empowerment of student opinion and input."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2981ea3d-64b9-3e4c-937b-02851888eb7e",
                                        "entry_id": "c4fe1c8e-5fee-3cde-9b72-667aa0d4f702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of supporting another person or persons to discover and claim personal power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc6f3773-8b74-4dd0-ac2a-a1f1b66ed1a4",
                                                "sense_id": "2981ea3d-64b9-3e4c-937b-02851888eb7e",
                                                "text": "The new model, by contrast, is about empowerment. It’s about listening, not talking. It’s about compassion, empathy and humility. It’s about understanding that power is amplified when it’s shared."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ff00456-a0b3-3e55-96d0-d4c01fa568b9",
                                        "entry_id": "c4fe1c8e-5fee-3cde-9b72-667aa0d4f702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being empowered (either generally, or specifically)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "140dcdd7-269a-3952-bc6d-0a61b1954940",
                                        "entry_id": "c4fe1c8e-5fee-3cde-9b72-667aa0d4f702",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Government programs encouraging advancement of blacks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Africa"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
